    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/7b5551689059d1962f0fe84e5eca0cb0.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Welcome to your new job, NPC: Giving out quests to local adventurers!<br></li><li>Choose quests which are appropriate to their level to help them become mighty, and perhaps some day one of your clients will become the hero of the town.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/497de36451f9e9b604c542f995baa1fa.poster.avif?t=1745760869\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/497de36451f9e9b604c542f995baa1fa.apng?t=1745760869\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=331 /></picture></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/922d6f1b49fbc472f6d1a0400bae485a.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><strong>Each With Multiple Endings:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get Fired<br></li><li> Get Assassinated<br></li><li> Destroy the Entire World<br></li><li> Join a Cult<br></li><li> Start a Mutiny<br></li><li> ... and More!</li></ul><i>(A full playthrough is <strong>3-5 hours</strong>, a completionist run is 10+)</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/c9117246b3fb9ff54473cabe40cd82f1.avif?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=331 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/dd3db32482d465606d7503aa2cbea3b0.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><strong>Featuring Responsive Dialogue:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/8172e6a716d286b46118b7eede72eca0.poster.avif?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/8172e6a716d286b46118b7eede72eca0.webm?t=1745760869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/fbb5e37f1fc5dbc959d0d4fbe842c8ff.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><strong>Who each have their own:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Personality<br></li><li> Class &amp; level<br></li><li> Likes &amp; dislikes</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/e71c714d51cb0c42306fea3f069479fe.poster.avif?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/e71c714d51cb0c42306fea3f069479fe.webm?t=1745760869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><i>A selection of the world's mighty heroes! (aka not you.)</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Playable with controller, mouse, keyboard, or hybrid<br></li><li>Playable with 1 or 2 hands<br></li><li>Curvy font option for readability vs the traditional pixel font<br></li><li>Option to adjust the text speed to show dialog fast vs. instantly</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/c41fd1d3a6573d801d82679816150301.webp?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=58 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/7b5551689059d1962f0fe84e5eca0cb0.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Welcome to your new job, NPC: Giving out quests to local adventurers!<br></li><li>Choose quests which are appropriate to their level to help them become mighty, and perhaps some day one of your clients will become the hero of the town.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/497de36451f9e9b604c542f995baa1fa.poster.avif?t=1745760869\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/497de36451f9e9b604c542f995baa1fa.apng?t=1745760869\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=331 /></picture></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/922d6f1b49fbc472f6d1a0400bae485a.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><strong>Each With Multiple Endings:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get Fired<br></li><li> Get Assassinated<br></li><li> Destroy the Entire World<br></li><li> Join a Cult<br></li><li> Start a Mutiny<br></li><li> ... and More!</li></ul><i>(A full playthrough is <strong>3-5 hours</strong>, a completionist run is 10+)</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/c9117246b3fb9ff54473cabe40cd82f1.avif?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=331 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/dd3db32482d465606d7503aa2cbea3b0.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><strong>Featuring Responsive Dialogue:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/8172e6a716d286b46118b7eede72eca0.poster.avif?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/8172e6a716d286b46118b7eede72eca0.webm?t=1745760869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/fbb5e37f1fc5dbc959d0d4fbe842c8ff.webp?t=1745760869\" width=350 height=58 /></span><br><strong>Who each have their own:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Personality<br></li><li> Class &amp; level<br></li><li> Likes &amp; dislikes</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/e71c714d51cb0c42306fea3f069479fe.poster.avif?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/e71c714d51cb0c42306fea3f069479fe.webm?t=1745760869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><i>A selection of the world's mighty heroes! (aka not you.)</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Playable with controller, mouse, keyboard, or hybrid<br></li><li>Playable with 1 or 2 hands<br></li><li>Curvy font option for readability vs the traditional pixel font<br></li><li>Option to adjust the text speed to show dialog fast vs. instantly</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604920/extras/c41fd1d3a6573d801d82679816150301.webp?t=1745760869\" width=600 height=58 /></span>",
